{"title":"Popular","artist":"Kristin Chenoweth","sourceId":"reference:special_popular_wicked_obc","sourceHash":"f755bb2c113c541ca55b38e9e0a208fd357abccb97989c530862fb359dc2f700","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","referenceProvider":"LRCLIB","referenceId":34624768,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":0.34,"end":5.21,"text":"Elphie, now that we're friends, I've decided to make you my new project.","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":5.21,"end":7.45,"text":"You really don't have to do that","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":7.45,"end":13.18,"text":"I know. That's what makes me so nice!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":13.18,"end":17.93,"text":"Whenever I see someone less fortunate than I","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":17.93,"end":22.56,"text":"(And let's face it, who isn't less fortunate than I?)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":22.56,"end":26.55,"text":"My tender heart tends to start to bleed","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":26.55,"end":28.59,"text":"And when someone needs a makeover","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":28.59,"end":30.12,"text":"I simply have to take over","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":30.12,"end":36.56,"text":"I know I know exactly what they need","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":36.56,"end":40.17,"text":"And even in your case","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":40.17,"end":44.75,"text":"Though it's the toughest case I've yet to face,","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":44.75,"end":49.86,"text":"Don't worry, I'm determined to succeed","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":49.86,"end":61.7,"text":"Follow my lead, and yes, indeed, you will be...","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":61.7,"end":63.47,"text":"Popular!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":63.47,"end":66.23,"text":"You're gonna be popular!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":66.23,"end":68.2,"text":"I'll teach you the proper ploys","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":68.2,"end":69.57,"text":"When you talk to boys","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":69.57,"end":71.65,"text":"Little ways to flirt and flounce","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":71.65,"end":73.62,"text":"Oooh! I'll show you what shoes to wear","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":73.62,"end":75.2,"text":"How to fix your hair","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":75.2,"end":78.25,"text":"Everything that really counts to be...","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":78.25,"end":79.91,"text":"Popular!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":79.91,"end":82.57,"text":"I'll help you be popular!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":82.57,"end":84.41,"text":"You'll hang with the right cohorts","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":84.41,"end":85.96000000000001,"text":"You'll be good at sports","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":85.96000000000001,"end":88.58,"text":"Know the slang you've got to know","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":88.58,"end":89.69,"text":"So let's start","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":89.69,"end":94.57,"text":"'Cause you've got an awfully long way to go...","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":94.57,"end":97.1,"text":"Don't be offended by my frank analysis","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":97.1,"end":99.93,"text":"Think of it as personality dialysis","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":99.93,"end":103.81,"text":"Now that I've chosen to become a pal, sister and adviser","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":103.81,"end":105.21000000000001,"text":"There's nobody wiser","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":105.21000000000001,"end":106.68,"text":"Not when it comes to...","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":106.68,"end":108.3,"text":"Popular","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":108.3,"end":110.95,"text":"I know about popular","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":110.95,"end":112.85,"text":"And with an assist from me","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":112.85,"end":114.45,"text":"To be who you'll be","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":114.45,"end":117.35,"text":"Instead of dreary, who you were... well, are","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":117.35,"end":118.88,"text":"There's nothing that can stop you","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":118.88,"end":122.52,"text":"From becoming popu-ler... lar...","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":122.52,"end":128.32,"text":"La la, la la!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":128.32,"end":133.63,"text":"We're gonna make you pop-u-lar...","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":133.63,"end":136.38,"text":"When I see depressing creatures","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":136.38,"end":139.13,"text":"With unprepossessing features","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":139.13,"end":144.6,"text":"I remind them on their own behalf to think of","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":144.6,"end":147.02,"text":"Celebrated heads of state","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":147.02,"end":150.13,"text":"Or 'specially great communicators","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":150.13,"end":152.78,"text":"Did they have brains or knowledge?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"49","start":152.78,"end":154.87,"text":"Don't make me laugh!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"50","start":154.87,"end":156.36,"text":"They were popular!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"51","start":156.36,"end":159.79,"text":"Please, it's all about popular!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"52","start":159.79,"end":161.73,"text":"It's not about aptitude","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"53","start":161.73,"end":163.18,"text":"It's the way you're viewed","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"54","start":163.18,"end":166.26,"text":"So it's very shrewd to be","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"55","start":166.26,"end":172.45,"text":"Very, very popular like me!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"56","start":172.45,"end":180.61,"text":"Why, Miss Elphaba, look at you. You're beautiful!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"57","start":187.03,"end":189.55,"text":"And though you protest","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"58","start":189.55,"end":192.74,"text":"Your disinterest","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"59","start":192.74,"end":199.0,"text":"I know clandestinely","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"60","start":199.0,"end":200.96,"text":"You're gonna grin and bear it","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"61","start":200.96,"end":203.87,"text":"Your new found popularity","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"62","start":203.87,"end":205.11,"text":"Ohh!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"63","start":205.11,"end":209.38,"text":"La la, la la!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"64","start":209.38,"end":210.45,"text":"You'll be popular","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"65","start":210.45,"end":220.07999999999998,"text":"Just not quite as popular as me!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}